text:
WHO ARE THIS 300 PEOPLE WHO DISLIKE...
I MEAN THIS IS PERFECT ;3;
❤️❤️

This is a very unique emotion appearing in people’s hearts nowadays because of coronavirus — emptiness, loneliness, strange feeling that you are not existing in thus moment, that you’re just in a time capsule;

and for people whose life was considered on performing and showing something to others, especially in real time, live on stage — it feels so hard not to be able to present their hard work, so it seems like their efforts are going to nowhere, but in the same time it’s obvious that there’s nobody to blame in this, it’s like a short circuit.

No-one knows how to feel that  stopped time, so such situation separates us from each other, but on the other hand we are all cooking in one boiler and this makes us feel the same; 

even if just a little bit, we are now closer together not by the distance , but by souls.

This means something, i swear

Stay's: Do you want to kill us, Mr. Hyunjin !?



Hyunjin: Yes ;-;


Kisses from Brazil!! We B-Stay's love you very much !!!!!!!
